    {
      "id": "act1_trial_property_photo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 01. Property Photo\n**功能**：Open the trial pipeline with the breakup logistics photo and message.\n**说话人**：旁白\n**情绪**：stung\n`act1_trial_property_photo`"
    },
    {
      "id": "act1_trial_office_shame_test",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 02. Office Shame Test\n**功能**：Show Su Ming at work testing the shame-response prompt.\n**说话人**：苏明\n**情绪**：shame\n`act1_trial_office_shame_test`"
    },
    {
      "id": "act1_trial_coworker_pressure",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 03. Coworker Pressure\n**功能**：Introduce outside judgment and workplace noise around the test prompt.\n**说话人**：周骁\n**情绪**：exposed\n`act1_trial_coworker_pressure`"
    },
    {
      "id": "act1_trial_self_authored_reply",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 840,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 04. Self Authored Reply\n**功能**：Mark the moment Su Ming types the one line that lands emotionally.\n**说话人**：苏明\n**情绪**：careful\n`act1_trial_self_authored_reply`"
    },
    {
      "id": "act1_trial_meeting_sell_safety",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 05. Meeting Sell Safety\n**功能**：Compress the meeting into a beat about monetizing being 'received.'\n**说话人**：旁白\n**情绪**：numb\n`act1_trial_meeting_sell_safety`"
    },
    {
      "id": "act1_trial_lunch_heat_memory",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1400,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 06. Lunch Heat Memory\n**功能**：Shift from work pressure into bodily discomfort and old associative shame.\n**说话人**：旁白\n**情绪**：dizzy\n`act1_trial_lunch_heat_memory`"
    },
    {
      "id": "act1_trial_forum_hint",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1680,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 07. Forum Hint\n**功能**：Introduce the companion-device forum as the first visible path into the pipeline.\n**说话人**：周骁\n**情绪**：tempted\n`act1_trial_forum_hint`"
    },
    {
      "id": "act1_trial_anonymous_forum",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3080,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 08. Anonymous Forum\n**功能**：Turn private shame into a cleaner anonymous forum path about buying a machine.\n**说话人**：旁白\n**情绪**：drawn-in\n`act1_trial_anonymous_forum`"
    },
    {
      "id": "act1_trial_product_page",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3360,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 09. Product Page\n**功能**：Present the polished sales page and modular pitch without turning it into final copy.\n**说话人**：旁白\n**情绪**：fixated\n`act1_trial_product_page`"
    },
    {
      "id": "act1_trial_demo_reply",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3640,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 10. Demo Reply\n**功能**：Echo the exact line from work through the product demo preview.\n**说话人**：系统演示\n**情绪**：uncanny\n`act1_trial_demo_reply`"
    },
    {
      "id": "act1_trial_order_form",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3920,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 11. Order Form\n**功能**：Reduce checkout to installment choice, stale emergency contact, and hesitation.\n**说话人**：旁白\n**情绪**：cornered\n`act1_trial_order_form`"
    },
    {
      "id": "act1_trial_payment",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4200,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 12. Payment\n**功能**：End the trial pipeline on the irreversible payment beat.\n**说话人**：旁白\n**情绪**：committed\n`act1_trial_payment`"
    },
    {
      "id": "act1_trial_property_pickup",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -520,
      "y": 1960,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 07A. Property Pickup\n**功能**：Show the property desk as an administrative end of the relationship.\n**说话人**：旁白\n**情绪**：sterile\n`act1_trial_property_pickup`"
    },
    {
      "id": "act1_trial_street_aftertaste",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -520,
      "y": 2240,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 07B. Street Aftertaste\n**功能**：Carry the property scene into street nausea, debt reminder, and emotional residue.\n**说话人**：旁白\n**情绪**：sour\n`act1_trial_street_aftertaste`"
    },
    {
      "id": "act1_trial_rental_return",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -520,
      "y": 2520,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 07C. Rental Return\n**功能**：Move the story back into the old building and shared apartment hallway.\n**说话人**：旁白\n**情绪**：compressed\n`act1_trial_rental_return`"
    },
    {
      "id": "act1_trial_room_cleanup",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -520,
      "y": 2800,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 07D. Room Cleanup\n**功能**：Reduce the room scene to isolation, messages cleared, and search intent.\n**说话人**：苏明\n**情绪**：lonely\n`act1_trial_room_cleanup`"
    }
  ],
